  "translation": "Gomme kgosí Rkhaboama a romela ⟨את⟩ Adorame, yena yo a bego godimo ga mošomo wa mašaka; gomme Yisraela ka moka ba mo ragela maswika, a hwetša a swerwe ke maswika go fihla lehohong la ka ntle, a hwala; gomme kgosí Rkhaboama a ikokobetša go namela koloi ya go fwala, go šea Yerushalayime.",
